<title>USA: UCAR International names Robert Hart COO.</title>
<headline>UCAR International names Robert Hart COO.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UCAR International Inc said on Monday that it has named Robert Hart to the newly-created positions of chief operating officer and senior vice-president.</p>
<p>Hart was previously vice-president and general manager of North Ameria and South America operations for the company.</p>
<p>UCAR is a manufacturer of graphite and carbon electrodes used principally in electric arc furnaces for steel production.</p>
<p>The company had $948 million in sales in 1996.</p>
